it to your support team.

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:35.920
And you can deploy it to a
specific organization as well.

00:07:35.920 --> 00:07:39.360
Finally, you don't even
have to push out an app

00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:41.100
to everyone in your domain.

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:44.160
Rather, you can let individuals
come to the G Suite Marketplace

00:07:44.160 --> 00:07:47.630
